+                        "The log is uploaded to mclo.gs and you get a link to give to whoever helps with the problem. "
+                        + "Anyone with the link can see it. Folder paths and your name are removed before sending."))
+                .setPositiveButton(Ui.t("Отправить", "Send"), new DialogInterface.OnClickListener() {
+                    public void onClick(DialogInterface d, int w) {
